Mostly ok, with three gaps: (1) the file list is one record per line, so a file's row loses the directory heading it sits under (dirs and files go to two separate tables); (2) the summary's Times row has blank Skipped/Mismatch cells only distinguishable by position, so that table is matched by robocopy's fixed 10-char columns; (3) the Windows error text and "Waiting N seconds... Retrying..." under an ERROR line are continuation lines of that error and are skipped rather than attached to it.
